## Structure

```
src/
├── config/
│   └── settings.py        ← env loading
├── errors/
│   └── app_error.py       ← error classes
├── shared/
│   └── database/          ← ORM setup
└── blueprints/<module>/
    ├── __init__.py             ← Blueprint
    ├── <module>_model.py       ← SQLAlchemy model
    ├── <module>_repository.py  ← data access
    ├── <module>_service.py     ← business logic
    ├── <module>_views.py       ← Flask route handlers
    └── <module>_test.py        ← pytest tests
```
app.py                   ← Flask app factory
```

